## Phase 2 (This Session)

### Database Optimizations (5 migrations)

**A1. RLS `initplan` optimization** — Wrapped `auth.uid()` and `auth.role()` in [(select ...)](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/HRM/source/contexts/language-context.tsx#520-523) across **~35 policies** on 18 tables. This prevents re-evaluation per row.

**Bug fix:** `employee_requests` policies were comparing `employees.id = auth.uid()` (wrong — [id](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/HRM/source/components/app-sidebar.tsx#64-697) is employee UUID, not auth UUID). Fixed to use `employees.auth_user_id = (select auth.uid())`.

**A2. Added RLS policies** for 4 tables that had RLS enabled but no policies:
- `employee_dependents` — employee can view own, admin/HR manage all
- `financial_categories` — authenticated read, admin/accountant write
- `leave_balances` — employee can view own, admin/HR manage all
- `salary_deductions` — employee can view own, admin/HR/accountant manage all

